{"schema_version":"0.4.1","doc_type":"dataset","dataset_id":"nm000172","name":"High-gamma dataset described in Schirrmeister et al. 2017","description":"The High-gamma dataset contains 128-channel EEG recordings from 14 healthy participants performing cue-based executed movements of the left hand, right hand and feet, plus rest. It was introduced to evaluate end-to-end decoding with deep convolutional neural networks against filter bank common spatial patterns (FBCSP), and to visualize the spectral power modulations these networks learn. This version is a BIDS-formatted derivative generated with MOABB.","source":"nemar","recording_modality":["EEG"],"bids_version":null,"license":"CC-BY-4.0","authors":[{"name":"Robin Tibor Schirrmeister","name_type":"Personal","orcid":"0000-0002-5518-7445","affiliations":[{"name":"Translational Neurotechnology Lab, Epilepsy Center, Medical Center - University of Freiburg, Engelberger Str. 21; Freiburg 79106 Germany","identifier":null,"scheme":null},{"name":"BrainLinks-BrainTools Cluster of Excellence, University of Freiburg, Georges-Köhler-Allee 79; Freiburg 79110 Germany","identifier":null,"scheme":null}]},{"name":"Jost Tobias Springenberg","name_type":"Personal"},{"name":"Lukas Dominique Josef Fiederer","name_type":"Personal","orcid":"0000-0003-1803-9694","affiliations":[{"name":"Translational Neurotechnology Lab, Epilepsy Center, Medical Center - University of Freiburg, Engelberger Str. 21; Freiburg 79106 Germany","identifier":null,"scheme":null},{"name":"BrainLinks-BrainTools Cluster of Excellence, University of Freiburg, Georges-Köhler-Allee 79; Freiburg 79110 Germany","identifier":null,"scheme":null},{"name":"Neurobiology and Biophysics; Faculty of Biology, University of Freiburg, Hansastr. 9a; Freiburg 79104 Germany","identifier":null,"scheme":null}]},{"name":"Martin Glasstetter","name_type":"Personal"},{"name":"Katharina Eggensperger","name_type":"Personal"},{"name":"Michael Tangermann","name_type":"Personal"},{"name":"Frank H